==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm}} {{term|gladly|lang=enm}}, {{term|gladliche|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|ang}} {{term|glædlice|glædlīċe|gladly|lang=ang}}, equivalent to {{suffix|glad|ly}}. Compare {{etyl|da|-}} {{term|glædelig||joyful|lang=da}}, {{etyl|is|-}} {{term|gleðilegur||delightful|lang=is}}. More at {{l|en|glad}}, {{l|en|-ly}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-gladly.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# In a [[glad]] manner; [[happily]].

====Derived terms====
* [[suffer fools gladly]]

